<section id="A6.SS7.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Per-seed breakdown.</h5>

<div id="A6.SS7.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS7.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For full transparency, Table <a href="#A6.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ Per-seed breakdown. ‣ F.7 Robustness to Random Seed ‣ Appendix F Training Details ‣ HyperEyes: Dual-Grained Efficiency-Aware Reinforcement Learning for Parallel Multimodal Search Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> reports the
per-seed accuracy and average turns on every benchmark. The
six-benchmark average accuracy stays within a <math id="A6.SS7.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.4</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.4</annotation></semantics></math>-point band
(<math id="A6.SS7.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="63.7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>63.7</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">63.7</annotation></semantics></math>–<math id="A6.SS7.SSS0.Px3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="64.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>64.1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">64.1</annotation></semantics></math>) and the average tool turns stay within a <math id="A6.SS7.SSS0.Px3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.04" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.04</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.04</annotation></semantics></math>
band (<math id="A6.SS7.SSS0.Px3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2.17" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2.17</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2.17</annotation></semantics></math>–<math id="A6.SS7.SSS0.Px3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2.20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2.20</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2.20</annotation></semantics></math>) across all three seeds, confirming that the
reported numbers in Table <a href="#S4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ HyperEyes: Dual-Grained Efficiency-Aware Reinforcement Learning for Parallel Multimodal Search Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> are not the result
of a favorable seed.</p>
</div>
